		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=517#comment-1433</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Vasheest introduced me to Sufism when i was only fifteen, and gave me the name Karima at the City of Refuge on the Big Island of Hawaii.  It has been my name ever since, and I will never forget him.  He was my teacher and my friend, taught me singing lessons and believed in me and encouraged me on my spiritual journey.  I will miss him.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Vasheest introduced me to Sufism when i was only fifteen, and gave me the name Karima at the City of Refuge on the Big Island of Hawaii.  It has been my name ever since, and I will never forget him.  He was my teacher and my friend, taught me singing lessons and believed in me and encouraged me on my spiritual journey.  I will miss him.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
